Rule 1 (Dot product axis cannot be the batch axis and must be within the rank of both input tensors, and the sizes along this axis must match)
{v_1 : int, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : tensor} |= v_1 > 0 ∧ v_1 < ndim(v_2) ∧ v_1 < ndim(v_3) ∧ shape(v_2, v_1) = shape(v_3, v_1)
