Rule 6 (If L2-normalization is enabled, the inputs must have floating-point dtypes: np.float16, np.float32, or np.float64)
{v_1 : bool, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : tensor} |= if v_1 = true then (dtype_(v_2) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 8) ∧ (dtype_(v_3) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_3) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_3) = 8)
